The '''Bingo Wisdom Talisman''' is a {{Common}} [[Accessory]] obtainable on [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profiles.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Bingo Wisdom Talisman''' may be offered when talking to {{NPCSprite|Bingo}} or {{NPCSprite|Chuckleton}} on a [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profile after completing a set number of goals.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Accessory
|name = Bingo Wisdom Talisman
|rarity = c
|global_wisdom = 5
}}

== Trivia ==
*As it is {{Soulbound}}, the '''Bingo Wisdom Talisman''' cannot be transferred from a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile to any other profile.

